  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "For a compound to be aromatic,\r\n(i) It should be planar\r\n(ii) it should have $(4 n+2) \\pi$ electrons\r\n(iii) It should be able to delocalise its $\\pi$ electron density.\r\nAmong the given compounds. 1,3,5,7 -cyclooctatetraene or cyclooctatetraene is not aromatic as its structure is non-planar.\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/2016_che_a30.png\">",
